":"math","value":"W _ {F} - Q _ {R} + W _ {f} + m g \\sin 3 0 ^ {\\circ} \\cdot \\frac {\\sqrt {3}}{6} L = \\frac {1}{2} m v ^ {2} - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"W _ {F} = (1 + \\beta) I _ {0} I L - \\frac {\\sqrt {3}}{1 2} m g L + \\frac {1}{2 4} m \\left(\\frac {I r _ {0} L}{k I _ {0}}\\right) ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--yiwu-moni-2505-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--yiwu-moni-2505","source_question_id":"yiwu-moni-2505-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6503a0ac9ac942887edd80a6b5c99c321b60e7eb78ea0e49b33b2e37aab1d2a0","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）光电倍增管是用来将光信号转化为电信号并加以放大的装置，其主要结构为多个相同且平行的倍增极。为简单起见，现只研究其第1倍增极和第2倍增极，其结构如图所示。第1倍增极 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" ，第2倍增极 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{2} a"},{"type":"text","value":" ，两个倍增极平行且竖直放置，如图所示（图中长度数据已知，过第1倍增极 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 端做垂线与第2倍增极的上端竖直延长线交于 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" ）。当频率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu"},{"type":"text","value":" 的入射光照射到第1倍增极右表面时，从极板右表面上逸出大量速率不同、沿各个方向运动的光电子。若在全部区域加上垂直于纸面的匀强磁场可使从第1倍增极逸出的部分光电子打到第2倍增极右表面，从而激发出更多的电子，实现信号放大。已知第1倍增极金属的逸出功为 "},{"type":"math","value":"W"},{"type":"text","value":" ，元电荷为 "},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电子质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，普朗克常量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h"},{"type":"text","value":" ，只考虑电子在纸面内的运动，忽略相对论效应，不计重力。\n（1）求从第1倍增极上逸出的光电子的最大动量大小；\n（2）若以最大速率、方向垂直第1倍增极逸出的光电子可以全部到达第2倍增极右表面，求磁感应强度的大小范围；\n（3）若保持（2）中的磁场的最大值不变，关闭光源后，发现仍有光电子持续击中第2倍增极，若第2倍增极的上端 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 端长度改为可以调节，其 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 端与 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 点的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 调节范围为： "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3} a \\le x \\le \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3} a"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求关闭光源后光电子持续击中第2倍增极的时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 的关系。（角度可用反三角函数表示，提示：已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta = k"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = \\arcsin k"},{"type":"text","value":" ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5ce979ebb282a01d3cba5d30ce85c3842a0f9da300cb466a2cc1af04177dcb38.png","width":474,"height":884,"width_mm":55.739,"row_group":"yiwu-moni-2505-q18-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{k}} = h\\nu -W"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"p_m = \\sqrt{2m(h\\nu - W)}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{1} = a"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"r _ {1} = \\frac {p _ {m}}{e B _ {1}} \\quad (1 \\text{分}) \\quad B _ {1} = \\frac {\\sqrt {2 m (h \\nu - W)}}{a e}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(\\frac{1}{3}a\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{3}a-r_{2}\\right)^{2}=r_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分，几何关系图画对也给分）"},{"type":"math","value":"r _ {2} = \\frac {p _ {m}}{e B _ {2}} \\quad B _ {2} = \\frac {2 0 \\sqrt {m (h \\nu - W)}}{1 7 a e} \\text{(1分)}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {2 0 \\sqrt {m (h \\nu - W)}}{1 7 a e} <   B <   \\frac {\\sqrt {2 m (h \\nu - W)}}{a e} \\text{(1分)}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）相切："},{"type":"math","value":"a^{2} = x^{2} + \\left(\\frac{2}{3}a\\right)^{2}, \\quad x = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}a"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{am\\left(2\\pi - \\arcsin\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}\\right)}{\\sqrt{2m(h\\nu - W)}}, \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}a \\le x < \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}a\\right); \\quad \\frac{am\\left(2\\pi - 2\\arcsin\\frac{\\sqrt{\\frac{a^{2}}{9}+x^{2}}}{2a}\\right)}{\\sqrt{2m(h\\nu - W)}}, \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}a \\le x \\le \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3}a\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"(4 分，每段各两分)"}]}}]}
